{"seq":3,"slug":"estimation-error-and-limits","title":"估计误差与 MPT 的局限 — Estimation Error and the Limits of MPT","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/estimation-error-and-limits","wordCount":1967,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"估计误差与-mpt-的局限-estimation-error-and-the-limits-of-mpt\">估计误差与 MPT 的局限 — Estimation Error and the Limits of MPT</h1><p>马科维茨的均值-方差优化在理论上无懈可击：给定真实的期望收益向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它能解出有效前沿上每一个最优组合。问题出在「给定真实参数」这个前提——现实中我们从不知道 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只能用历史样本去估计它们。一旦把样本估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9023em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9495em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9495em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 喂进优化器，输出的「最优」权重往往是极端、不稳定、且样本外表现糟糕的。本文拆解这种失效的数学机理，量化它有多严重，并梳理 2026 年仍在用的几类缓解手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>均值-方差优化器是一台「误差放大器」。理论解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">w</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>γ</mi></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{w}^* = \\frac{1}{\\gamma}\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3712em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 中出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是关键：协方差矩阵求逆会把估计噪声成倍放大。当两个资产的相关性被样本高估时，优化器会误以为存在一个「近乎无风险的套利」——做多一个、做空另一个——于是分配出巨大的多空头寸。MOSEK 的优化手册直接称之为「优化器倾向于在估计误差最大的方向上下重注」（<a href=\"https://docs.mosek.com/portfolio-cookbook/estimationerror.html\">MOSEK Portfolio Optimization Cookbook, ch.4</a>）。Michaud 早在 1989 年就给这种现象起了个流传至今的名字：<strong>误差最大化（error maximization）</strong>。</p>\n<p>下图描述了误差如何从输入流到失效输出：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[历史收益样本&lt;br/&gt;有限且含噪] --&gt; B[样本估计量&lt;br/&gt;mu-hat / Sigma-hat]&#10;    B --&gt; C{均值-方差优化器&lt;br/&gt;w = inv-Sigma mu / gamma}&#10;    C --&gt; D[Sigma 求逆&lt;br/&gt;放大相关性误差]&#10;    C --&gt; E[mu 误差直接&lt;br/&gt;主导权重方向]&#10;    D --&gt; F[极端多空头寸&lt;br/&gt;权重不稳定]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[样本外 Sharpe 崩塌&lt;br/&gt;高换手 高交易成本]\">flowchart TD\n    A[历史收益样本&lt;br/&gt;有限且含噪] --&gt; B[样本估计量&lt;br/&gt;mu-hat / Sigma-hat]\n    B --&gt; C{均值-方差优化器&lt;br/&gt;w = inv-Sigma mu / gamma}\n    C --&gt; D[Sigma 求逆&lt;br/&gt;放大相关性误差]\n    C --&gt; E[mu 误差直接&lt;br/&gt;主导权重方向]\n    D --&gt; F[极端多空头寸&lt;br/&gt;权重不稳定]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[样本外 Sharpe 崩塌&lt;br/&gt;高换手 高交易成本]</pre><p>不同输入参数的误差，对结果的破坏力并不相等。下表对比三类参数的估计难度与影响：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>估计难度</th>\n<th>对权重的影响</th>\n<th>经验结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>期望收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>极难（信噪比低，需极长样本）</td>\n<td>最大，直接决定权重方向</td>\n<td>Chopra-Ziemba(1993)：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 的误差影响约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 10 倍以上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>σ</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma_i^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0728em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高频数据可较好估计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相关性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>难（维度爆炸，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim N^2/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>）</td>\n<td>通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被放大</td>\n<td>高维下样本协方差矩阵接近奇异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「估计期望收益比估计协方差矩阵难得多，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的误差对权重影响更大」是文献的共识结论（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0927539825000416\">ScienceDirect, Portfolio optimization with estimation errors, 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"误差最大化的数学机理\">误差最大化的数学机理</h2><p>为什么求逆会放大噪声？把协方差矩阵做特征分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma} = \\sum_i \\lambda_i \\mathbf{v}_i \\mathbf{v}_i^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1488em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则其逆为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{-1} = \\sum_i \\lambda_i^{-1} \\mathbf{v}_i \\mathbf{v}_i^\\top</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1539em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8542em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4231em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1031em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2769em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\" style=\"margin-right:0.016em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:-0.016em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。最小的几个特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取倒数后变成最大的权重因子。而恰恰是这些「最小方差方向」最难被样本准确估计——样本协方差矩阵的小特征值系统性地被低估，求逆后被进一步夸大。结果就是优化器把组合的大部分权重押在统计上最不可靠的方向上。</p>\n<p>维度灾难让情况雪上加霜。要估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个资产的协方差矩阵，需要估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N+1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立参数。当资产数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 与样本观测期数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 同阶（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 不趋于零）时，样本协方差矩阵不再是一致估计量，其特征值谱按 Marchenko-Pastur 分布严重「散开」。2026 年的高维研究路线正是用随机矩阵理论（RMT）来刻画并修正这种偏差：Meng 等人（2025）提出基于 RMT 的方法，在一般协方差结构下一致地估计并校正样本外 Sharpe 比率，从而支持可靠的参数调优（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2606.13697\">arXiv, high-dimensional mean-variance, 2026</a>）。</p>\n<p>一个直观的判别量是条件数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa(\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}) = \\lambda_{\\max}/\\lambda_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，矩阵越接近奇异，求逆越不稳定。当样本期不足时，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 趋近于 0，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 爆炸，优化结果对输入的微小扰动极度敏感——这正是「最优解极不稳定」的代数根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"量化失效-1-n-为什么常常赢\">量化失效：1/N 为什么常常赢</h2><p>「估计误差有多严重」最有冲击力的实证答案来自 DeMiguel、Garlappi、Uppal（2009）。他们在七个真实数据集上评估了 14 种优化模型，结论是：<strong>没有一种模型在 Sharpe 比率、确定性等价收益或换手率上能稳定地胜过最朴素的等权重 1/N 组合</strong>——样本外，优化分散化带来的收益被估计误差完全抵消（<a href=\"https://academic.oup.com/rfs/article-abstract/22/5/1915/1592901\">Review of Financial Studies, 22(5), 2009</a>）。</p>\n<p>更尖锐的是他们对「需要多长样本才能让优化打败 1/N」的测算。基于美股市场校准的参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组合资产数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>让样本均值-方差胜过 1/N 所需估计窗口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>25</td>\n<td>约 3000 个月（250 年）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>约 6000 个月（500 年）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>也就是说，对一个 50 资产的组合，你需要五百年不间断、且分布平稳的历史数据，朴素优化才在统计上值得一用——这在现实中显然不可得（<a href=\"https://papers.ssrn.com/sol3/papers.cfm?abstract_id=1376199\">SSRN, Optimal Versus Naive Diversification</a>）。1/N 的优势恰恰在于它<strong>不估计任何参数</strong>，因此完全免疫于估计误差。这把矛头指向 MPT 的真正局限：它不是模型错了，而是模型对输入质量的要求远超数据能提供的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓解手段-从约束到贝叶斯\">缓解手段：从约束到贝叶斯</h2><p>实务界从不直接用裸样本估计跑优化。2026 年仍在主流使用的缓解手段大致可分四类，按「介入点」组织如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[估计误差缓解] --&gt; B[约束权重&lt;br/&gt;禁卖空 上下限]&#10;    A --&gt; C[改进估计量&lt;br/&gt;收缩 因子模型]&#10;    A --&gt; D[贝叶斯先验&lt;br/&gt;Black-Litterman]&#10;    A --&gt; E[鲁棒优化&lt;br/&gt;不确定集 RMT 校正]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[Ledoit-Wolf 收缩&lt;br/&gt;把样本拉向结构化目标]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[CAPM 均衡收益作先验&lt;br/&gt;投资者观点更新]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[精度矩阵行和约束&lt;br/&gt;减少未知参数]\">graph TD\n    A[估计误差缓解] --&gt; B[约束权重&lt;br/&gt;禁卖空 上下限]\n    A --&gt; C[改进估计量&lt;br/&gt;收缩 因子模型]\n    A --&gt; D[贝叶斯先验&lt;br/&gt;Black-Litterman]\n    A --&gt; E[鲁棒优化&lt;br/&gt;不确定集 RMT 校正]\n    C --&gt; C1[Ledoit-Wolf 收缩&lt;br/&gt;把样本拉向结构化目标]\n    D --&gt; D1[CAPM 均衡收益作先验&lt;br/&gt;投资者观点更新]\n    E --&gt; E1[精度矩阵行和约束&lt;br/&gt;减少未知参数]</pre><p><strong>约束法</strong>最简单：加上「不许卖空」「单一资产权重 ≤ 5%」等线性约束，能直接堵住误差最大化产生的极端头寸。Jagannathan-Ma（2003）证明禁卖空约束在数学上等价于一种隐式的协方差收缩——约束本身就在降噪。</p>\n<p>**收缩估计量（shrinkage）**的思想源自 Stein 1955 年的开创性工作，2000 年代初由 Ledoit-Wolf（2004）引入金融，把含噪的样本协方差矩阵按最优比例拉向一个结构化目标（如单位矩阵或常相关模型），用引入少量偏差换取方差的大幅下降（<a href=\"https://docs.mosek.com/portfolio-cookbook/estimationerror.html\">MOSEK Cookbook, ch.4</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>Black-Litterman 模型</strong>从根上回避了用噪声历史数据估 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：它以 CAPM 隐含的市场均衡收益作为贝叶斯先验，再让投资者用自己的观点去更新，因此「不需要噪声历史数据来做估计」（<a href=\"https://bookdown.org/palomar/portfoliooptimizationbook/3.6-prior-information-shrinkage-factor-models-and-blacklitterman.html\">bookdown, Portfolio Optimization Book §3.6</a>）。2025 年的延伸把这套框架推向新输入源：有研究用 ESG 分数作为对均衡风险溢价做 Stein 收缩的偏置（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2511.21850\">arXiv 2511.21850, Black-Litterman and ESG, 2025</a>）；也有工作用 LLM 自动化、可扩展地生成前瞻性观点注入 BL 模型（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2504.14345v2\">arXiv 2504.14345, LLM-Enhanced Black-Litterman, 2025</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>鲁棒优化</strong>则承认参数本身落在一个不确定集内，求「最坏情况下最优」的权重。2025 年有框架转而约束精度矩阵的行和而非直接处理样本协方差，从而大幅减少未知参数数量（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S0927539825000416\">ScienceDirect, robust linear regression approach, 2025</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MPT 的数学是对的，局限在于它假设输入参数已知；真实世界只有含噪的样本估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\mu}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9023em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7079em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0134em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9495em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9495em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2551em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>优化器是「误差最大化器」：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Σ</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\Sigma}^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Σ</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8901em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.139em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把最难估计的最小特征值方向倒数放大，在统计上最不可靠处下重注。</li>\n<li>期望收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{\\mu}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计误差影响最大（约为协方差的 10 倍量级）；高维下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 不趋于零时样本协方差矩阵失去一致性。</li>\n<li>DeMiguel 等（2009）的实证：14 种优化模型无一稳定胜过等权 1/N；让朴素优化打败 1/N 需要 25 资产约 250 年、50 资产约 500 年的数据。</li>\n<li>主流缓解四路：权重约束（隐式收缩）、收缩估计量（Ledoit-Wolf）、贝叶斯先验（Black-Litterman，2025 年已接入 ESG 与 LLM 观点）、鲁棒优化（不确定集 / RMT 校正）。</li>\n<li>实务底线：永远不要把裸样本估计直接喂进优化器——降噪、加结构、加先验，是让 MPT 真正可用的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"估计误差与 MPT 的局限 — Estimation Error and the Limits of MPT","id":"估计误差与-mpt-的局限-estimation-error-and-the-limits-of-mpt"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"误差最大化的数学机理","id":"误差最大化的数学机理"},{"level":2,"text":"量化失效：1/N 为什么常常赢","id":"量化失效-1-n-为什么常常赢"},{"level":2,"text":"缓解手段：从约束到贝叶斯","id":"缓解手段-从约束到贝叶斯"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"有效前沿与 CAPM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/modern-portfolio-theory/efficient-frontier-and-capm"},"next":{"title":"Black-Litterman 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/portfolio-optimization-asset-allocation/robust-allocation-methods/black-litterman-model"}}